{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "Titan EGT",
  "author": "FIPinator 3000",
  "description": "Cessna 404 Titan EGT: two edgewise scales, 0-5 divisions, L and R pointers (taken as EGT \u00B0F / 100; 240 \u00B0F read about 2.4 in the cockpit, to confirm).",
  "canvas": {
    "width": 320,
    "height": 240,
    "background": "#3D4145"
